<% content_for(:title){'Nikky Southerland'} %>
<header class="head">
  <div class="row align-top">
    <div class="small-12 medium-6">
      <%= image_tag 'nikky.jpg', alt: 'Nikky Southerland' %>
    </div>
    <div class="small-12 medium-6 content">
      <h1>Nikky Southerland</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        <span class="lead-line">Philadelphian</span>
        <span class="lead-line">Software Engineering Leader</span>
        <span class="lead-line">Photographer</span>
      </p>
      <nav class="contact-links" aria-label="Contact and social links">
        <a href="mailto:site@nikkysoutherland.com" aria-label="Email Nikky">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-envelope" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <span>site@nikkysoutherland.com</span>
        </a>
        <a href="https://bsky.app/profile/nykida.net" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Nikky on Bluesky">
          <svg class="bluesky-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5.2 3.8c2.6 2 5.1 6.1 6.8 8.2 1.7-2.1 4.2-6.2 6.8-8.2C20.7 1.9 23.5 1.2 23.5 4.5c0 .7-.4 5.5-.6 6.3-.8 2.8-3.5 3.5-5.9 3.1 4.2.7 5.3 3.1 3 5.5-4.3 4.5-6.2-1.1-7.9-3.5-1.7 2.4-3.6 8-7.9 3.5-2.3-2.4-1.2-4.8 3-5.5-2.4.4-5.1-.3-5.9-3.1-.2-.8-.6-5.6-.6-6.3C.7 1.2 3.5 1.9 5.2 3.8Z" /></svg>
          <span>@nykida.net</span>
        </a>
        <a href="https://instagram.com/allynfolksjr" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <i class="fa-brands fa-instagram" aria-hidden="true"></i> Instagram
        </a>
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/nikkys" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <i class="fa-brands fa-linkedin" aria-hidden="true"></i> LinkedIn
        </a>
        <a href="https://flickr.com/photos/allynfolksjr" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <i class="fa-brands fa-flickr" aria-hidden="true"></i> Flickr
        </a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="purple section" aria-labelledby="engineering-heading">
  <div class="row align-middle">
    <div class="small-12 medium-7 small-order-2 medium-order-1">
      <p>
        I work as a team/technical lead full-stack developer, specializing in Ruby on Rails. I have a particular interest in
        understanding users and building empathy for their use cases.
      </p>
      <p>Engineering Talks:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="https://www.rubyevents.org/talks/spaceships-radiation-therapy-and-power-users" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Spaceships, Radiation Therapy, and Power Users (Blastoff Rails 2026)</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="small-12 medium-5 small-order-1 medium-order-2">
      <h2 id="engineering-heading">Engineering</h2>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="blue section no-padding" aria-labelledby="photography-heading">
  <div class="row align-middle">
    <div class="small-12 medium-7 small-order-1 medium-order-1 image photography-image">
      <%= render partial: 'flickr', locals: {photos: @flickr_photos} %>
    </div>
    <div class="small-12 medium-5 small-order-2 medium-order-2 photography-copy">
      <h2 id="photography-heading">Photography</h2>
      <p>
        One of the ways I explore the world around me is through the lens of a camera. I shoot both film and digital with a wide
        array of cameras. All of my black-and-white film is self-developed.
      </p>
      <p><i class="fa-brands fa-flickr" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <%= link_to "View all photos on Flickr", 'https://flickr.com/photos/allynfolksjr', target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener noreferrer' %>
        <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square" aria-hidden="true"></i>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="purple section" aria-labelledby="philadelphia-heading">
  <div class="row align-middle">
    <div class="small-12 medium-5"><h2 id="philadelphia-heading">Philadelphia</h2></div>
    <div class="small-12 medium-7">
      <p>
        Seattle was my home for 18 years, but now I live in Philadelphia! Being on the East Coast has been a revelation. Much has changed over the years,
        but the water and mountains remain constants. Being a Washington native, I don't mind the grey skies and rainy seasons.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="blue section" aria-labelledby="ham-heading">
  <div class="row align-middle">
    <div class="small-12 medium-7 small-order-2 medium-order-1">
      <p>I'm a General Class Amateur Radio Operator mostly exploring APRS and digital modes. <a href="https://www.qrz.com/db/N1KKY" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View my profile on QRZ.com</a></p>
    </div>
    <div class="small-12 medium-5 small-order-1 medium-order-2"><h2 id="ham-heading">N1KKY</h2></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="white section" aria-labelledby="uw-heading">
  <div class="row align-middle">
    <div class="small-12 medium-5"><h2 id="uw-heading">University of Washington</h2></div>
    <div class="small-12 medium-7">
      <p>
        I have a Bachelor of Arts from the University of Washington in Seattle, and majored in <em>Law, Societies, and Justice</em>
        with minors in <em>Political Science</em> and <em>Human Rights</em>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="purple section" aria-labelledby="blogging-heading">
  <div class="row align-middle">
    <div class="small-12 medium-5"><h2 id="blogging-heading">Blogging</h2></div>
    <div class="small-12 medium-7">
      <p>
        I've been writing at my blog for <%= Time.current.year - 2004 %> years now at
        <a href="https://nykida.net" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">nykida.net <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>.
        There's no particular theme.
      </p>
      <%= render partial: 'blog_posts', locals: {posts: @wordpress_posts} %>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="blue section no-padding" aria-labelledby="minerva-heading">
  <div class="row align-middle">
    <div class="small-12 medium-7 small-order-1 medium-order-1 image">
      <%= image_tag 'minerva.jpg', alt: 'Minerva the cat', width: '700' %>
    </div>
    <div class="small-12 medium-5 small-order-2 medium-order-2">
      <h2 id="minerva-heading">Minerva</h2>
      <p>
        I live with a cat named <strong>Minerva</strong>. Her primary skills are cuddling and hissing at everyone.
        She's not particularly great at hunting the bugs around our house and usually spends her days chirping at
        the crows that perch outside our windows. (Sometimes she can catch gnats.)
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
